Recommends: nano
Suggests: docker-compose-v2 | docker-compose-plugin
Description: terminal UI to manage a Caddy server running in Docker
 caddy-tui is a dependency-free terminal interface for administering a Caddy
 web server that runs in a Docker container.
 .
  * Edit the Caddyfile safely: changes are validated before saving, with
    automatic backups; hot reload without downtime.
  * Wizard to add reverse-proxy services (HTTPS upstreams, gzip, security
    headers, access log, basic authentication).
  * Live traffic monitor: requests per second, status codes, latency, top
    domains and client IPs.
  * Guided diagnostics that detect and fix common problems: stale Caddyfile
    inside the container, unpublished ports, services on other Docker networks,
    missing host.docker.internal, undefined variables.
  * Start, stop, restart, logs, formatting, backup and restore.
 .
 The container, Caddyfile and docker compose project are autodetected. The
 interface is available in English and Spanish.
